   ("Walks from the door","Trails start in the village and lead up to the Rocca Sillana fortress and through oak woods and fields. Traffic on the lanes is light. In summer, walk early in the morning and in the evening, and keep the middle of the day for the shade of the loggia."),
   ("Beaches with dogs","The Etruscan Coast is 45 to 60 minutes away. Cecina and San Vincenzo have stretches of beach and beach clubs that accept dogs. In Tuscany dogs are allowed on a lead in public outdoor areas, including beaches, subject to local rules, which can change by season, so check before you go. Bring water and shade."),
